001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TCOMPRES.
001300 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        5/01/85.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.  THIS SUBPROGRAM TAKES A FIELD OF UP TO 14 BYTES
001900*          LONG, AND STRIPS IT OF ANY NON-ALPHANUMERIC
002000*          CHARACTERS (I.E. SPACES, SLASHES, DASHES, ETC).
002100*
002200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002600
002700 DATA DIVISION.
002800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002900
003000 77  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
003100 77  SUB2                          PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
003200
003300 01  DEST-FLD-AREA                 PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
003400
003500 01  DEST-FLD REDEFINES DEST-FLD-AREA.
003600     05  D-BYTE OCCURS 14 TIMES    PIC X.
003700
003800 LINKAGE SECTION.
003900 01  RET-CODE                      PIC X(2).
004000
004100 01  SOURCE-FLD.
004200     05  S-BYTE OCCURS 14 TIMES    PIC X.
004300
004400 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING RET-CODE, SOURCE-FLD.
004500
004600 6-MAIN.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB, SUB2.
           MOVE SPACES TO DEST-FLD-AREA.
004700 61-EXAMINE-LOOP.
004800     ADD 1                         TO  SUB.
004900     IF SUB > 14
005000         GO TO 62-MOVE-FIELD.
005100
      *------ NOTE: THIS IS FOR IBM'S EBCDIC.  FOR ASCII THIS LINE
      *------ WOULD READ: IF S-BYTE (SUB) < "0"
005200     IF S-BYTE (SUB) < "a"
               GO TO 61-EXAMINE-LOOP
005400     ELSE
005500         ADD 1                     TO  SUB2
005600         MOVE S-BYTE (SUB)         TO  D-BYTE (SUB2).
005700
005800     GO TO 61-EXAMINE-LOOP.
005900
006000 62-MOVE-FIELD.
006100     MOVE DEST-FLD                 TO  SOURCE-FLD.
006200
006300     GOBACK.
